# ```
# User → Oracle.talk() → Iris spec decode (qwen3-0.6b)
#   ├── high confidence → Iris responds
#   └── low confidence → entity match → ModelGateway → 9-provider fabric
# ```
#
# ### Core Subsystems (src/omega/)
# | System | Path | Status | Role |
# |--------|------|--------|------|
# | **Oracle** | `src/omega/oracle/oracle.py` | ✅ v2.3.0 | Intent detection, entity routing, Iris speculative decode |
# | **Entity Registry** | `src/omega/oracle/entity_registry.py` | ✅ | YAML-backed CRUD, auto-scaffolds workspaces |
# | **Model Gateway** | `src/omega/oracle/model_gateway.py` | ✅ | 9-backend fabric |
# | **Memory Store** | `src/omega/memory_store.py` | ✅ | Hot/Warm/Cold/Temp tiers |
# | **SQLite-Vec** | `src/omega/memory/sqlite_vec_adapter.py` | 🟡 Strike 10 | Primary vector store (Qdrant deprecated) |
# | **Ingestion** | `src/omega/ingestion/` | ✅ | T1→T2→T3 extraction + CAS |
# | **AxiomRegistry** | `src/omega/oracle/axiom_registry.py` | ✅ v1.1.0 | Five-Fold Foundation loader |
# | **Firewall Checker** | `src/omega/audit/firewall_checker.py` | ✅ | M2 Engine-Stack Firewall scanner |
# | **Observability** | `src/omega/observability/` | ✅ | Trace IDs, BLEG, sovereignty ratio |
# | **Soul System** | `src/omega/oracle/soul_distiller.py` | ✅ | L1→L2→L3 gnosis distillation |
# | **Sovereign Search** | `src/omega/oracle/sovereign_search_service.py` | ✅ | 5-tier search fabric |
# | **Hivemind** | `mcp_servers/omega_hub/` | ✅ v2.2.0 | 83 MCP tools, cross-agent coordination |
# ## HANDOFF CONSTRUCTION (Cline ↔ OpenCode)
#
# When delegating to an OpenCode agent, use inline context delivery (D216 mandate):
#
# ```python
# hivemind_submit_handoff(
#     source="cline/omega-engine",
#     target="opencode/<entity>",   # kali, maat, lilith, doom_guy, jem, verity, researcher, roc_racoon
#     priority=0|1|2,               # 0=normal, 1=high, 2=critical
#     task="<one-line description>",
#     context="""<INLINE context per D216 — file paths alone are unreliable>""",
#     expected_output="<file path, schema, or report>",
#     relevant_files=["<paths>"]
# )
# ```
#
# **D216 Mandate**: All context MUST be embedded inline in prompt text.
# File paths are supplementary only — subagents cannot reliably read files.
#
